# File structure for VS Code Copilot Hooks

vscode-prompts/.github/hooks/
├── README.md                        # Complete documentation
├── session-notifications.json       # SessionStart, Stop events
├── subagent-notifications.json      # SubagentStart, SubagentStop events
├── prompt-notifications.json        # UserPromptSubmit event
└── scripts/
    └── notify.sh                    # macOS notification handler

# Installation files (repo root)
├── install-hooks.sh                 # One-command setup
└── test-notification.sh             # Test notifications

# Runtime (created by installer)
~/.agent-box-toolkit/
└── hooks/                           # Symlink to repo hooks
    ├── README.md
    ├── *.json
    └── scripts/notify.sh

~/.agent-box/
└── logs/
    └── notifications.log            # All notifications logged here
